# Live wallpaper: a scene of scripts/wallpaper/bins/spinning_globe (see
# bins/sailboat); the selector lists this file and previews it with
# bevy/apps/sailboat (same scene), which the lock screen also draws.
# A sloop alone off Daytona Beach: the real sun, moon and stars for the time of
# day there, and the real wind, clouds, rain, thunder and sea (Open-Meteo, cached
# in ~/.cache/sailboat/weather.env, refreshed every 10 minutes).
